meta {
  name: admin
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Every route under `/v1/admin` requires an **admin** access token from identity
  (401 without a valid token, 403 for customers, 503 when identity's JWKS is unreachable).

  To get one: register and verify a user, promote it with
  `pnpm -s --filter @ecommerce/identity users:promote <email>`, then run **identity / auth / Login**
  (a token issued before the promotion still says `customer`).
}
